{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-credit-limit","title":"动态授信额度与调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-supply-chain-finance/credit-risk/dynamic-credit-limit","wordCount":2295,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态授信额度与调整\">动态授信额度与调整</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>评分回答&quot;这个商家有多好&quot;，额度回答&quot;那么最多借他多少&quot;。从分数到额度不是一次线性映射，而是一个带约束的决策过程：平台想要的是在给定风险偏好下最大化额度效用，同时不突破资金方的敞口上限与行业的集中度限制。</p>\n<p>把额度拆成三层可以让这个决策变得可维护：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{total}} = \\min\\left( L_{\\text{base}} \\cdot \\prod_k f_k ,\\; L_{\\text{cap}} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基准额度（由流水与评分推出），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是调整因子（类目、季节性、履约、外部征信等），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{cap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是硬上限（资金方限制、行业集中度、监管上限）。三层分离的好处是每一层的变更理由不同、变更频率不同、审批权限也不同——基准额度跟随经营数据月度重算，调整因子可以事件驱动，硬上限则由资金方协议决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[评分 PD] --&gt; B[基准额度 Lbase]&#10;  C[结算流水与动销] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D[调整因子层]&#10;  D --&gt; E[类目因子]&#10;  D --&gt; F[季节性因子]&#10;  D --&gt; G[履约因子]&#10;  D --&gt; H[外部征信因子]&#10;  E --&gt; I[乘算得到候选额度]&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{与硬上限比较}&#10;  J --&gt;|超过| K[取 cap]&#10;  J --&gt;|未超| L[取候选值]&#10;  K --&gt; M[写入额度账本]&#10;  L --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; N[事件驱动再调整]\">graph TD\n  A[评分 PD] --&gt; B[基准额度 Lbase]\n  C[结算流水与动销] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D[调整因子层]\n  D --&gt; E[类目因子]\n  D --&gt; F[季节性因子]\n  D --&gt; G[履约因子]\n  D --&gt; H[外部征信因子]\n  E --&gt; I[乘算得到候选额度]\n  F --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{与硬上限比较}\n  J --&gt;|超过| K[取 cap]\n  J --&gt;|未超| L[取候选值]\n  K --&gt; M[写入额度账本]\n  L --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; N[事件驱动再调整]</pre><p>额度账本本身的结构与占用规则已经在第一章定义，见 <a href=\"../financing-products/merchant-credit-line\">循环授信额度</a>；本篇只讨论&quot;总额度这个数字是怎么来的、什么时候变&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基准额度的推导\">基准额度的推导</h2><p>基准额度的输入只有两类：商家的现金流规模与现金流质量。规模用结算流水衡量，质量用评分衡量。最简单的形式是&quot;月均结算额 × 倍数 × 评分系数&quot;，但直接乘倍数有两个隐患：一是月均会被极端值污染，二是评分与流水高度相关，直接相乘会重复计入。</p>\n<p>更稳健的做法是先对流水做<strong>稳健化处理</strong>，再与评分做非线性组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>PD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{base}} = \\tilde{S} \\cdot m \\cdot g(\\text{PD})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是稳健化的月度结算额（用中位数或截尾均值替代算术平均），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是行业基准倍数（通常落在 0.5–3 个月的结算额区间），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>PD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\text{PD})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是随 PD 递增而递减的系数函数，可用对数或幂函数形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>PD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>PD</mtext><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mtext>PD</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\text{PD}) = \\left(\\frac{\\text{PD}_{\\text{ref}}}{\\text{PD}}\\right)^{\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4543em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种形式的优点是在低 PD 区间平缓、高 PD 区间陡降，符合平台&quot;宁可少放不要多放&quot;的风险偏好。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值决定了额度对风险变化的敏感度，通常由业务与风险共同定，取值在 0.3–0.8 之间。</p>\n<p>还要处理<strong>新商家</strong>问题。没有历史流水的商家无法算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，此时有两种策略：一是给一个很小的&quot;起步额度&quot;（例如固定 1–5 万）并要求补充材料，二是把额度与首笔交易绑定（例如按首单金额的固定比例给备货额度）。前者更简单，后者与备货贷的场景结合更自然。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调整因子的设计\">调整因子的设计</h2><p>调整因子是额度模型中业务干预最集中的地方，也是最容易失控的地方。每个因子都必须满足三个条件：有明确的经济含义、有数据支撑、有独立的作用域（不与其它因子共线）。</p>\n<p><strong>类目因子</strong>反映不同品类的经营风险。快消标品的需求稳定、周转快，可以给较高倍数；时尚类目受季节与潮流影响大，倍数应偏低；3C 类目单价高、跌价快，虽然流水大但风险也高。这个因子通常按类目固定，由风险委员会审定。</p>\n<p><strong>季节性因子</strong>解决的是&quot;同一商家在不同月份额度需求差几倍&quot;的问题。如果不做季节性处理，商家在大促前会被迫申请临时提额。正确的做法是让季节性因子只作用在<strong>有效期内</strong>：大促前 60 天开始上浮，大促结束后 30 天内自动回落到基准。工程上这要求额度调整事件支持&quot;定时生效&quot;与&quot;定时失效&quot;，而不是只能立即生效。</p>\n<p><strong>履约因子</strong>直接来自平台内数据，包括发货时效达标率、退款率、纠纷率。它的价值在于<strong>反应快</strong>：流水数据要一个月才能看出趋势，而履约异常可能在几天内暴露。一个常用的规则是&quot;近 30 天纠纷率超过类目 P90 则因子下调 20%&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>外部征信因子</strong>在有数据时提供增量信息，尤其是司法涉诉、税务异常、失信被执行这类事件型信号。这类信号的特点是<strong>稀疏但强</strong>：平时毫无变化，一旦命中几乎可以直接否决。因此它更适合做成&quot;否决项&quot;而非&quot;乘数&quot;，或做成一个幅度很大的惩罚因子。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>刷新频率</th>\n<th>典型影响范围</th>\n<th>是否可否决</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类目</td>\n<td>类目配置</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>±50%</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性</td>\n<td>大促日历</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>+0%~+100%</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约</td>\n<td>平台内履约</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>−40%~+10%</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部征信</td>\n<td>第三方征信</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n<td>−100%~0%</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金方</td>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>硬上限</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动的调整与防抖\">事件驱动的调整与防抖</h2><p>动态额度的&quot;动态&quot;二字在实现上意味着额度会频繁变化，而频繁变化本身会造成两种伤害：一是商家的体验受损（今天能借明天不能借），二是系统产生大量无用事件（额度抖动引发通知风暴与前台展示异常）。</p>\n<p>**防抖（debounce）**因此不是可选项。常见规则包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>额度变化幅度小于 10% 且未跨越档位时，不触发对外通知与实际调整</li>\n<li>同一商家 7 天内至多触发一次自动额度调整</li>\n<li>下调可以立即生效，上调必须经过一个观察期（例如 3 天），防止刷单套额度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&quot;上调需观察、下调可立即&quot;这条不对称规则非常关键。它同时防住了两类攻击：刷单冲高流水骗额度，以及风险暴露后商家快速提款后跑路。与之配套的是<strong>额度冻结</strong>：一旦命中强风险信号，直接把额度置为 FROZEN（状态定义见第一章），仅允许还款不允许提款。</p>\n<p>防抖还必须处理<strong>并发调整</strong>。如果评分任务、履约事件、大促日历在同一天都触发了调整，最终的总额度应该是按顺序施加还是只取最后一次？稳健的做法是给额度调整定义一个确定性的优先级（硬上限 &gt; 否决项 &gt; 事件型因子 &gt; 例行重算），并按优先级顺序施加，而不是简单按时间戳覆盖。每一次调整都要留痕，记录触发源、旧值、新值与依据，这既是审计要求也是问题排查的必需品。变更留痕与评分模型的版本管理是同一套治理要求，见 <a href=\"data-driven-credit\">基于交易与流水的信用评分</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"额度与资金方约束\">额度与资金方约束</h2><p>平台自己设定的额度不能超过资金方愿意承担的上限。这是一个<strong>多约束取小</strong>问题：商家的信用额度、资金方给平台的授信额度、平台对该商家的自留风险上限、行业集中度限制，四者取最小。</p>\n<p>资金方约束的特殊之处在于它是<strong>双层的</strong>：资金方给平台一个总额度池，平台再切分给商家。如果平台把池子耗尽，后面的商家即使信用良好也拿不到钱，这就产生了第一章提到的 SUSPENDED 状态。因此额度系统需要一张&quot;资金方额度用量表&quot;，实时反映每家资金方的剩余可用额度，并让提款路由据此决策。多资金方之间的分配策略属于第三章，见 <a href=\"../funding-disbursement/funding-allocation\">多资金方资产分配</a>。</p>\n<p>行业集中度约束也常被忽略。如果平台给单一类目的所有商家都放了高额度，那么该类目一旦遭遇政策或需求冲击，整个资产池会同步恶化。约束方式通常是&quot;单类目融资余额 / 平台融资总余额 &lt; 阈值&quot;，并在额度分配时对已超阈值的类目降额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>额度 = min(基准额度 × 调整因子, 硬上限) 三层结构；每层变更原因、频率与审批权限不同。</li>\n<li>基准额度用稳健化流水乘行业倍数与 PD 系数函数得到；新商家用起步额度或首单挂钩处理。</li>\n<li>调整因子须有经济含义、数据支撑与独立作用域；外部征信类稀疏强信号更适合做否决项。</li>\n<li>防抖规则必备：小变化不触发、限频、上调需观察期、下调立即生效；并发调整按优先级确定性施加。</li>\n<li>额度受资金方授信池、自留风险上限与行业集中度多重约束，提款路由需实时查询资金方剩余额度。</li>\n<li>每次额度调整必须留痕（触发源、旧值、新值、依据），这是审计与排障的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态授信额度与调整","id":"动态授信额度与调整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基准额度的推导","id":"基准额度的推导"},{"level":2,"text":"调整因子的设计","id":"调整因子的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动的调整与防抖","id":"事件驱动的调整与防抖"},{"level":2,"text":"额度与资金方约束","id":"额度与资金方约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于交易与流水的信用评分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-supply-chain-finance/credit-risk/data-driven-credit"},"next":{"title":"风险定价与利率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-supply-chain-finance/credit-risk/risk-pricing-rate"}}